# Content pipeline (MD → JSON)

## Sources (whitelist, project root)

| MD | Route |
|----|-------|
| `content.md` | `/` (home sections) |
| `faq.md` | `/faq` |
| `terms.md` | `/terms` |
| `privacy.md` | `/privacy` |

`README.md`, `figma-plugin-export-tokens/README.md`, and `example/` are **not** parsed.

## Workflow

1. Edit the relevant `*.md` in the project root.
2. Run `npm run sync:content`.
3. Commit both MD and generated `src/app/data/*.json`.

**Do not** hand-edit `src/app/data/*.json` — they are generated.

## Output layout

```
src/app/data/siteMeta.json
src/app/data/dataCasinoIntro.json
src/app/data/dataCasinoInfo.json
src/app/data/dataApp.json
src/app/data/dataAfterSupport.json
src/app/data/dataSupport.json
src/app/data/dataAfterFaq.json
src/app/data/dataFaq.json
src/app/data/dataLast.json
src/app/data/dataFooter.json
src/app/data/pages/{slug}.json
```

## Home section map (`content.md` → JSON → component)

| `##` in content.md | JSON file | Component |
|--------------------|-----------|-----------|
| preamble (`# H1` + paragraph) | `siteMeta.json` + `dataCasinoIntro.json` | BonusSection + CasinoIntroSection (`h1`, `title`, `description`; intro in `content`) |
| About Our Platform | `dataCasinoIntro.json` | CasinoIntroSection (`whoWeAre`) |
| Strengths and Shortcomings | `dataLast.json` | LastSection |
| Mobile Gaming | `dataApp.json` | AppSection (3 tabs: intro + `### Application` + `### Mobile Site`) |
| Banking | `dataCasinoInfo.json` | CasinoInfoSection (`sections[0]`) |
| Priority Status | `dataCasinoInfo.json` | CasinoInfoSection (`sections[1]`) |
| Games | `dataAfterSupport.json` | InfoSectionAfterSupport (`content` only, `sections: []`) |
| Casino Santander vs Starling UK | `dataSupport.json` | SupportSection (intro + table, no image) |
| Bonuses and Promotional Credit | `dataAfterFaq.json` | InfoSectionAfterFaq (intro + `###` as tab cards) |
| FAQ | `dataFaq.json` | FaqSection |

`dataFooter.json` ← `ogSiteName` from Title (part before ` - `).

## Language

Site language is fixed `en-GB` (`<html lang="en-GB">`, `openGraph.locale: en_GB`). No locale/geo routing.

## ContentItem types

Union in `src/app/interfaces/dataInterface.ts`: `paragraph`, `heading` (level 2–4), `list-dotted`, `list-number`, `table`.

Display via `ContentItems` / `plainContentText` — no `**`/HTML in JSON; style in CSS.

## Page layouts (`StaticRichPage`)

| variant | Pages | Blocks |
|---------|-------|--------|
| `footer-legal` | terms, privacy | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → sections |
| `footer-faq` | faq | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → FaqAccordionList |

Home page h1 lives in `BonusSection` (from `siteMeta.h1`), not `H1Section`.

## SEO

- Home: `src/app/data/siteMeta.json` → `src/app/layout.tsx`
- Secondary pages: `src/app/data/pages/*.json` `meta` → `src/app/utils/pageMetadata.ts`
